 "note": "Silent elaboration changes ruled on one declaration at a time, read by check_elaboration_drift.py --compare. Each entry pins the sha256 of the baseline fingerprint (docs/status/elab-baseline-v4330.json) and of the fingerprint accepted, so it covers exactly that change: any later change to the declaration is silent again and fails. Add an entry only with a verdict that says why the statement still means what it meant.",
